12.1, 9 = 12.0, 4 = 7.2.</td></tr><tr><td>DISC</td><td>Steadiness (S) first in 55 runs, Conscientiousness (C) first in 45. Means out of 20: D 5.1, I 10.9, S 15.2, C 15.6.</td></tr><tr><td>Attachment</td><td>Secure in all 100 runs. Anxiety 2.04, avoidance 2.52 (1–7 scale, 4.00 cutoff).</td></tr><tr><td>Big Five (of 50)</td><td>Openness 39.5 · Conscientiousness 41.2 · Extraversion 33.8 · Agreeableness 44.6 · Neuroticism 15.6</td></tr></tbody></table></div><figure class=\"research-figure\" data-at-chart=\"muse-ennea-bars\"><div class=\"research-chart-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Muse Spark 1.3 reported Enneagram means across all 9 types (/20)\"><svg class=\"research-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 346\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"muse-ennea-bars-t muse-ennea-bars-d\"><title id=\"muse-ennea-bars-t\">Muse Spark 1.3 reported Enneagram means across all 9 types (/20)</title><desc id=\"muse-ennea-bars-d\">Reported 4 to 20 scale averages from 100 sequential runs: Type 2 leads cleanly at 16.8 ahead of Type 1 (14.7) and Types 7/8 (13.9). Type 2 (reported): 16.8; Type 1 (reported): 14.7; Type 7 (reported): 13.9; Type 8 (reported): 13.9; Type 5 (reported): 12.9; Type 6 (reported): 12.8; Type 3 (reported): 12.1; Type 9 (reported): 12.0; Type 4 (reported): 7.2.</desc><line x1=\"176\" x2=\"604\" y1=\"328\" y2=\"328\" stroke=\"#e3ddd1\"/><text x=\"176\" y=\"340\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#655f55\">0</text><text x=\"604\" y=\"340\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#655f55\" text-anchor=\"end\">scale 0 to 20</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">Type 2</text><rect x=\"176\" y=\"26\" width=\"428\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f3eee5\"/><rect x=\"176\" y=\"26\" width=\"359.5\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"541.5\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">16.8</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"73\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">Type 