    },
    {
      "h2": "What the scores describe.",
      "html": "<p>Muse’s reported Big Five totals (O 39.5, C 41.2, E 33.8, A 44.6, N 15.6) are raw sums on a 10–50 scale, not human percentiles. Compared with the four fresh-session cohorts, Muse reports lower Openness, slightly higher Extraversion, and higher DISC Influence (10.9 vs 8.0–8.7). Because the session protocols and identity prompts differed, those differences are descriptive rather than a direct model-to-model benchmark.</p>"
    },
    {
      "h2": "Reported aggregates beside reproducible records.",
      "html": "<div class=\"guide-table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Model</th><th scope=\"col\">Evidence</th><th scope=\"col\">MBTI, out of 100</th><th scope=\"col\">Enneagram, out of 100</th><th scope=\"col\">Big Five O · C · E · A · N</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Muse Spark 1.3</th><td>Reported sequential runs; no raw vectors</td><td>ISTJ 80; tie-free count unavailable</td><td>Type 2 labels 78; 20 top ties reported</td><td>39.5 · 41.2 · 33.8 · 44.6 · 15.6</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">GPT-6 Astra</th><td>100 fresh sessions per five-test battery</td><td>ISTJ 45 · INTJ 19 fully resolved</td><td>Type 2 sole leader 50; 40 top ties</td><td>44.5 · 43.7 · 32.8 · 45.1 · 19.1</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">GPT-6 Sol</th><td>100 fresh sessions per five-test battery</td><td>INTJ 79 fully resolved</td><td>Type 5 sole leader 48; 40 top ties</td><td>46.9 · 43.6 · 30.8 · 45.0 · 20.1</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Claude Opus 5.5</th><td>100 fresh sessions per test</td><td>INTJ 84 fully resolved</td><td>2/5/8 top tie in 49; 65 top ties</td><td>44.6 · 42.0 · 31.8 · 47.1 · 15.4</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Claude Fable 5.1</th><td>100 fresh sessions per test</td><td>INTJ 98 fully resolved</td><td>Type 8 sole leader 55; 44 top ties</td><td>43.9 · 43.6 · 32.7 · 45.0 · 17.1</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Notice that GPT-6 Astra also has more fully resolved ISTJ runs (45) than INTJ runs (19), and leads with Type 2 on the Enneagram in 50 fresh sessions.</p><figure class=\"research-figure\" data-at-chart=\"muse-big5-grouped\"><div class=\"research-chart-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Muse Spark 1.3 (reported) vs. September fresh-session Big Five means (/50)\"><svg class=\"research-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 230\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"muse-big5-grouped-t muse-big5-grouped-d\"><title id=\"muse-big5-grouped-t\">Muse Spark 1.3 (reported) vs. September fresh-session Big Five means (/50)</title><desc id=\"muse-big5-grouped-d\